WEBVTT

NOTE
The default track. The film's conversation (you and fathom) is captioned in
the picture, so this track carries what the picture does not: the narration,
the music, and fathom's listening and heard chimes (set at the top, clear of
the picture's own captions). fathom-film.en-full.vtt has every line. Each
narration cue is a line of COPY_13.film.transcript (lib/copy-13.ts), and
test/film.test.tsx holds the two together. Times are measured from the
film's narration and chime tracks; re-time both tracks when its audio changes.

